WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.934 --> 00:00:10.468
This is my pet.

2
00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:12.471
His name is Digly.

3
00:00:12.472 --> 00:00:18.670
He can do many tricks.

4
00:00:18.671 --> 00:00:21.151
Digly can sit down.

5
00:00:21.152 --> 00:00:27.076
"Digly, sit down!"

6
00:00:27.077 --> 00:00:29.525
Digly can stand up.

7
00:00:29.526 --> 00:00:31.975
"Digly, stand up!

8
00:00:31.976 --> 00:00:36.364
Good boy!"

9
00:00:36.365 --> 00:00:40.020
Digly can jump up on a box.

10
00:00:40.021 --> 00:00:46.584
"Digly, jump up!"

11
00:00:46.585 --> 00:00:49.399
Digly can jump down.

12
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.200
"Digly, jump down!

13
00:00:52.201 --> 00:00:57.020
Good boy!"

14
00:00:57.021 --> 00:01:00.386
Digly can climb up a ladder.

15
00:01:00.387 --> 00:01:07.190
"Digly, climb up!"

16
00:01:07.191 --> 00:01:10.407
Digly can climb down a ladder.

17
00:01:10.408 --> 00:01:12.960
"Digly, climb down!

18
00:01:12.961 --> 00:01:17.882
Good boy."

19
00:01:17.883 --> 00:01:20.806
Digly can walk up the ramp.

20
00:01:20.807 --> 00:01:28.502
"Digly, walk up!"

21
00:01:28.503 --> 00:01:31.577
Digly can walk down the ramp.

22
00:01:31.578 --> 00:01:34.104
"Digly, walk down!

23
00:01:34.105 --> 00:01:38.809
Good boy!"

24
00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:42.382
Digly can lie down on the floor.

25
00:01:42.383 --> 00:01:47.711
"Digly, lie down!"

26
00:01:47.712 --> 00:01:49.894
Digly can get up.

27
00:01:49.895 --> 00:01:53.301
"Digly, get up!"

28
00:01:53.302 --> 00:02:00.660
"Digly, slow down!

29
00:02:00.661 --> 00:02:06.771
Digly, wait!"
